903
00:49:33,013 --> 00:49:34,972
Somebody help!

904
00:49:35,146 --> 00:49:36,582
Clifford!
What are you doing?

905
00:49:36,756 --> 00:49:38,758
- Priscilla!
- Jeron, please!

906
00:49:38,932 --> 00:49:41,413
- Somebody grab a ladder!
- Somebody!

907
00:49:41,587 --> 00:49:44,024
- Clifford!
