1167
01:01:50,968 --> 01:01:53,971
Okay, that's a terrible lie.
It is very far away.

1168
01:01:54,145 --> 01:01:56,843
But this is definitely
what's best for him.

1169
01:01:57,017 --> 01:01:57,931
I don't care.

1170
01:01:58,105 --> 01:01:59,193
Clifford came to me

1171
01:01:59,367 --> 01:02:01,979
